..........................................1............................................2.......................1........."},{"section":"served:repeat_rounds.r4d9j.spotlight.blocks[1].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"圓角外框內的引文。與第一篇不同，這篇**沒有預先加粗**卡關點，改由學生自己圈（見步驟1）","n":45,"ssz":"............................................."},{"section":"served:repeat_rounds.r4d9j.spotlight.blocks[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.任務：只抓「這一段大概在講什麼？」（約10–15字）　→我猜這段在講：【　】","n":40,"ssz":".........1.............................."},{"section":"served:repeat_rounds.r4d9j.spotlight.blocks[3].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"早期旅人鴿的數量很多","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:repeat_rounds.r4d9j.spotlight.blocks[4].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"步驟1：標示卡關點＋原因判斷","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:repeat_rounds.r4d9j.spotlight.blocks[5].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.請在框框中把你覺得讀不懂、會卡住的地方圈起來或畫線。","n":28,"ssz":"..........1................."},{"section":"served:repeat_rounds.r4d9j.spotlight.blocks[5].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學生在上面的引文框內自己圈／畫線，原稿沒有畫任何線","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:repeat_rounds.r4d9j.spotlight.blocks[6].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.你覺得你卡住的主要原因是什麼？（單選）","n":21,"ssz":"....1................"},{"section":"served:repeat_rounds.r4d9j.spotlight.blocks[6].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"專有名詞多，我看不懂「分類、習性、地名」這類詞","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:repeat_rounds.r4d9j.spotlight.blocks[6].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句子太長、資訊太多，我抓不到重點","n":16,"ssz":".1..........1..."},{"section":"served:repeat_rounds.r4d9j.spotlight.blocks[7].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"步驟2：忽略卡關點再讀一次（不中斷）","n":18,"ssz":"...........1......"},{"section":"served:repeat_rounds.r4d9j.spotlight.blocks[8].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.再讀一次卡關點：先跳過你圈起來的地方，直接往下讀，不要停。","n":31,"ssz":"....1......................1..."},{"section":"served:repeat_round